BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:koufonisia-pano-koufonisi-chora-feast-of-agios-georgios-patron-of-koufo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270424
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Georgios\, patron of Koufonisi
LOCATION:Pano Koufonisi (Chora)\, Koufonisia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:St George is the island's protector: after the liturgy on 23 April (or Easter Monday if the date falls in Lent) the icon is taken round the island by caique with the fishing boats escorting it along the coast\, the lanes are strewn with flowers\, and the community serves boiled beef and patsas with drinks before the party moves to the tavernas. A rare chance to see Koufonisi as a working fishing island before the season.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/koufonisia/#pano-koufonisi-chora-feast-of-agios-georgios-patron-of-koufo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/koufonisia/#pano-koufonisi-chora-feast-of-agios-georgios-patron-of-koufo
END:VEVENT
