BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:koufonisia-kato-koufonisi-dormition-panigiri-on-kato-koufonisi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri on Kato Koufonisi
LOCATION:Kato Koufonisi\, Koufonisia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On 15 August the whole island crosses by caique to the uninhabited Kato Koufonisi for the liturgy at the church of the Virgin\, followed by a free meal of fish and meat in the courtyard and a panigiri with kerasmata and violins\; the return crossing is an informal race between the boats\, and the winner's crew is feasted again. Boats fill up\, so be at the harbour early in the morning.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/koufonisia/#kato-koufonisi-dormition-panigiri-on-kato-koufonisi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/koufonisia/#kato-koufonisi-dormition-panigiri-on-kato-koufonisi
END:VEVENT
